Subject: [EXPERIMENTAL DARWIN PATCH] gambit: validate the whole member link request

Apply after 0041. A reproduced cross-group include mutation published a stale
binding. Preserve group-mode behavior; member mode requires both opt-ins and
rechecks all input/dependency/tool/environment identities before binding.
Whole-consumer performance and release qualification remain pending.

